 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Pick a spot that's easy to reach from two sides, not too close to a tree or the hill. That usually works well. Just make sure it not where the wind blows right at it from one direction. That's okay. You can drop a couple of branches and tie them into a little tent. That's also great, as long as it' not right next to the heat. A bit further away is fine. Exactly. And pitch the fly high enough the rain runs off it. A tarp over it helps, too.",
